{title: Wonderful}
{key: F}
{x_theme: grace-mercy, heaven, joy, praise, communion, salvation, name-of-jesus}
{x_source: chrd:wonderful.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
[F]Wonderful, wonderful, Jesus is to [C]me
Counselor, Prince of Peace, Mighty God is [F]He
He's saving me, keeping me from all sin and [Bb]shame
Wonderful is [F]my Redeemer, [C]praise His [F]name

{comment: Verse 1}
O [F]My Heart Sings Today, Sings For Joy And Glad[C]ness,
Jesus Saves, Satisfies, Banishes My Sad[F]ness;
Guilt Is Gone, Peace Is Mine, Peace Like To A [Bb]River,
Jesus Is Won[F]derful, [C]Mighty To [F]Deliver.

{comment: Verse 2}
Once A S[F]lave, Now I'm Free, Free From Condem[C]nation,
Jesus Gives Liberty And A Full Sal[F]vation;
Now The Sins Of The Past Have Been All For[Bb]given,
And My Name [F]Is Inscribed On The [C]Book Of [F]Heaven.

{comment: Verse 3}
[F]Living Here With My Lord In A Holy [C]Union,
Day By Day, All The Way Holding Sweet [F]Communion;
O What Change Grace Hath Wrought In My Lowly [Bb]Station!
Since My [F]Soul Has Received Full And [C]Free Sal[F]vation
